Clone this repository:
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/Early-Fusion-Laser-Acoustic-Human-Orientation-Detection.git
Open MATLAB.
Set the repository folder as the current working directory.
Run the MATLAB scripts according to the required analysis step.

For laser window creation:

run('code/lazer_windows_create36_preproces.m')

For acoustic signal import and channel averaging:

run('code/acoustic_import_8_avgchannel.m')

For laser-acoustic feature extraction and dataset creation:

run('code/laser_acoustic_dataset_create.m')

For early feature-level fusion:

run('code/laser_acoustic_data_fusion.m')

For acoustic channel visualization:

run('code/acoustic_channel_graph.m')

For PCA-based feature analysis:

run('code/evaluation_pca.m')

For correlation matrix analysis:

run('code/evaluation_corelation_matrix.m')
